    "Claude 会在对话中自己记下你的偏好、纠正和项目背景。开关对所有项目生效；关掉后不再读写，记忆留着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude notes your preferences, corrections and project background during conversations. The switch applies to all projects; when it's off, memories are kept but no longer read or written."
